    glm-5.3, STUDENT on zai glm-5.2 -- never happened. z.ai no longer serves
    glm-5.2: a request for it on the coding endpoint returns HTTP 200 with
    \"model\":\"glm-5.3\" in the body. Silent substitution, not a fallback --
    a nonsense model name on the same endpoint returns HTTP 400 \"modelCode:
    does not exist\", so the name is recognised and deliberately routed."
