   "Every zai seat -- guide, scribe and student -- has been running glm-5.3.
    Any frame whose reading depends on the student being a different or weaker
    model than the guide/scribe was not measuring that contrast. The casting
    block reports the REQUEST and cannot detect substitution; zai_api.clj says
    so at the :cost/model assignment."
   :how-it-surfaced
   "Joe read the z.ai usage panel and saw total consumption equal to 5.3
    consumption. The machine could not have told him: :cost/model is captured
    from the response but reaches only the in-memory invoke-jobs ring buffer,
    which the code notes is gone on JVM restart, and never lands in a frame
    record."
   :change
